  "hyperscaler_benchmark": "Snowflake AI Data Cloud; Google BigQuery; Databricks Lakehouse Platform; AWS Redshift; ClickHouse Cloud; Azure Synapse Analytics; Firebolt. The operational reason for a dedicated flat microservice is: per-tenant OLAP, workload isolation, retention tiers, secure data sharing, and analytical cost controls.",
